{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminarch is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where reflexes and adaptability mean everything. On a cosmic battlefield, you\u2019ll face endless waves of enemies that only grow stronger and more relentless with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than eight distinct weapons, every run feels different. Whether you rely on precise pistol shots, unleash chaos with rocket launchers, slice through foes with lasers, or scorch them with flamethrowers, the arsenal lets you shape your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave pushes harder. Each enemy won\u2019t let you breathe. The challenge never stops, and every second demands focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ weapons: pistols, rocket launchers, lasers, flamethrowers, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique space-themed arena atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relentless enemy waves with scaling difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pure arcade action with no downtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Perfect for players seeking hardcore challenges</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000260?t=1757378693","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000260?t=1757378693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000260/c858221d607cddd55155bd9d8105f12a844b5846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000260/c858221d607cddd55155bd9d8105f12a844b5846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminarch is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where reflexes and adaptability mean everything. On a cosmic battlefield, you\u2019ll face endless waves of enemies that only grow stronger and more relentless with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than eight distinct weapons, every run feels different. Whether you rely on precise pistol shots, unleash chaos with rocket launchers, slice through foes with lasers, or scorch them with flamethrowers, the arsenal lets you shape your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave pushes harder. Each enemy won\u2019t let you breathe. The challenge never stops, and every second demands focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ weapons: pistols, rocket launchers, lasers, flamethrowers, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique space-themed arena atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relentless enemy waves with scaling difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pure arcade action with no downtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Perfect for players seeking hardcore challenges</p>","developers":["g4m3d3s1gn studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000260/399890a5eb40219a80278de0e6aa561bdb8ab014/header.jpg?t=1757378693","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192216,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192216/movie480.mp4?t=1757378691","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192216/movie_max.mp4?t=1757378691"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192216/f96cddf712d72107b10ecd42bf31984eb97c746b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757378691","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192216/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757378691","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192216/movie_max_vp9.